asset:        058-key-opacity-2key.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture: base project with two Opacity keyframes, 0 percent at 0 s and 100 percent at 2 s
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
